This notice covers the Font Awesome interface icons embedded in web/js/app.js
and the Classic Regular `face-smile` icon embedded in web/js/reactions.js.
The latter is from Font Awesome Free 6.7.2, source SVG:
https://raw.githubusercontent.com/FortAwesome/Font-Awesome/6.7.2/svgs/regular/face-smile.svg
Its SVG path is embedded inline and rendered with scimux's currentColor
styling; no Font Awesome runtime or webfont is included.

